OCT 19–25                                 Ask ShiftPilot ⌕

         MON       TUE       WED       THU       FRI

Ravi     10–6      12–8                2–10      2–10

Neha     2–10                2–10      2–10

Aman     10–6      10–6      10–6                4–11

Priya              12–8      12–8      12–8      4–11


Coverage          97%
Labour Cost       ₹43,850
Overtime Risk     ₹620
Conflicts         0


              [ Optimize Schedule ]
