Managers should not need to interpret complex metrics.

For each hour:

```text
FRIDAY DINNER

6 PM       7 PM       8 PM       9 PM      10 PM

████████   ██████     █████      ███████   ███████
             ⚠          ⚠

Required cooks:     5
Scheduled cooks:    3
