# 51. 90-Second Recruiter Demo

The demo should tell one story.

## 0–10 sec

> ShiftPilot automatically builds employee schedules from availability, skills, labour cost and business constraints.

Click:

> Generate Schedule

Roster appears.

---

## 10–25 sec

Show:

```text
Coverage       98%
Cost           ₹43k
Overtime       ₹620
Conflicts      0
```

