---

## 40–60 sec

ShiftPilot generates three repair strategies.

Show:

```text
Lowest Cost

Least Disruptive

Best Coverage
```

Select the recommendation.

---

## 60–75 sec

Click:

> Why?

Show deterministic candidate explanation.

---

## 75–85 sec

Type:

> Students shouldn't work after 9 PM.

Show structured rule preview.

---

## 85–90 sec

Finish with:

```text
CP-SAT optimization
Natural language → deterministic constraints
